<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ABC College</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background-color: #f3f7fb;
      color: #222;
    }

    header {
      background-color: #164b78;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    nav {
      background-color: #103653;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 12px;
    }

    .banner {
      background-color: #dceeff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 15px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    section {
      background-color: white;
      margin: 16px 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #164b78;
    }

    .course {
      background-color: #eef5fb;
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #103653;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      nav a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 6px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>ABC College of Engineering</h1>
    <p>Learn, Grow, Succeed</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
    <a href="#facilities">Facilities</a>
    <a href="#admissions">Admissions</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="banner">
    <h2>Welcome to ABC College</h2>
    <p>Building knowledge and skills for a brighter future.</p>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section id="about">
      <h2>About Our College</h2>
      <p>ABC College provides students with quality education and opportunities to learn new skills.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="courses">
      <h2>Our Courses</h2>

      <div class="course">
        <h3>Computer Science Engineering</h3>
        <p>Learn programming, computers, and software development.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <h3>Mechanical Engineering</h3>
        <p>Learn about machines, design, and manufacturing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <h3>Electrical Engineering</h3>
        <p>Learn about electricity, circuits, and electrical systems.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="facilities">
      <h2>Campus Facilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Library</li>
        <li>Computer laboratories</li>
        <li>Sports ground</li>
        <li>College cafeteria</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="admissions">
      <h2>Admissions</h2>
      <p>Students can apply for admission by visiting the college office or college website.</p>
      <p>Please contact the college for admission dates and requirements.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Email: info@abccollege.edu</p>
      <p>Phone: 123-456-7890</p>
      <p>Address: Your City, Your State</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 ABC College of Engineering</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
